Pine v6 lexer, AST, and parser lifted from Pinecone
=====================================================

Source:  https://github.com/<pinecone-upstream>/pinecone
Paths:   crates/pine-lexer/src/lib.rs
         crates/pine-ast/src/lib.rs
         crates/pine-parser/src/lib.rs
License: Mozilla Public License 2.0 (see LICENSE in this directory)

The lifted files live under `src/syntax/{ast,lexer,parser}.rs` with a
per-file `SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0` header pointing back to
the upstream.

Changes from upstream:
  - Crate imports rewritten to in-tree module paths
    (`use super::ast::*` / `use super::lexer::*`).
  - The standalone `bin/pine-parser.rs` is not lifted; pine-oracle
    surfaces this functionality via `pine parse` / `pine tokens` in
    `src/main.rs`.
  - Error types use the original `thiserror`-derived enums; callers
    on the pine-oracle boundary convert to `anyhow::Result`.

Snapshot date: see git log for the introducing commit.
